The five native Python modules under spatial_jev/molmo2 are unmodified copies
of the model/processor implementation at the pinned revision. Jev-Spatial adds
a shared classification head, hierarchical inference, training and evaluation
code. The released weights merge the trained LoRA into Molmo2-ER and omit the
unused autoregressive vocabulary head. Configuration metadata is adapted to
load the implementation from the installed source package.

Jev / System One by TypeSafe is the project's conceptual inspiration.
This is an independent project, not an official TypeSafe implementation or
a reproduction of proprietary RLCD. Full acknowledgements are in README.md.

Training and benchmark media are not included. Their original attribution
and terms remain with their respective authors and distributors.
